          "role": "player",
          "text": "Keeping the lantern in trim through fog takes patience.",
          "persistVia": "conversation"
        },
        {
          "kind": "seed",
          "role": "player",
          "text": "They say the old-timers around here tell tales about a driver who spent many years hauling on the mine road — not you, surely?",
